# PROMPT 06 — INTELLIGENCE ADMIN CONTROL CENTER, AUTHENTICATION, BACKEND INTEGRATION & COMPREHENSIVE CYBERSECURITY

## PRIMARY MISSION

Upgrade the existing Intelligence application by implementing a complete, production-grade Admin Control Center and hardening the security of the entire application.

This phase has TWO equally important objectives:

1. Build and integrate the complete administrative system, including login, user permissions, configuration management, API key management, provider connections, backend operations, monitoring, and operational controls.
2. Perform comprehensive cybersecurity hardening across the frontend, backend, APIs, database, admin panel, authentication system, third-party integrations, and VPS deployment configuration.

Do not build a decorative dashboard with nonfunctional buttons. Inspect the actual repository, reuse the existing architecture, implement real functionality, and verify every critical operation.

Preserve all working Intelligence features, including news, the world intelligence interface, market data, arbitrage analysis, SEO, and AdSense integration.

Do not rebuild the entire application from scratch unless the existing architecture makes a specific component impossible to maintain safely.

