- Supported source categories.
- News freshness thresholds.
- Article retention and archive policies.
- Ingestion limits.
- Duplicate detection options.
- Retry limits and timeout settings.
- Source priority and classification settings.

### Financial data settings
- Enabled market data providers.
- Provider-specific polling intervals.
- Supported markets and instrument groups.
- Quote freshness thresholds.
- Data collection limits.
- Order-book depth settings.
- Rate limits and backoff policies.
- Arbitrage calculation parameters.
- Fee and slippage configuration where supported by reliable provider data.
- Stale-data safety controls.

### AI service settings
Only if AI integrations are actually implemented:

- Provider selection.
- Model identifier.
- API credentials.
- Request timeouts.
- Retry limits.
